{
  "name": "Order Tracking Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛒 Order Tracking Workflow\n**WooCommerce → Tracking Link Email for the Customer**\n\nReceives a WooCommerce webhook when an order moves to *processing*, verifies its HMAC signature, registers the order in the tracking sheet (Google Apps Script) and emails the customer a personal tracking link.\n\n**Flow:** Webhook → Topic filter → Signature check → Prepare data → Update tracking sheet → Email customer → Respond 200\n**On failure:** log the event → respond 401\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /webhook/order-update`\n\n### Setup checklist\n1. Select the **Crypto** credential (WooCommerce webhook secret)\n2. Connect the **Gmail OAuth2** credential\n3. Set the **Apps Script URL** and shared secret in both HTTP Request nodes\n4. Create the WooCommerce webhook pointing to the *Production* URL\n5. Run a test, then **Publish** the workflow",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 1020,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -540
      ],
      "id": "2cc97bc8-a2cf-45b1-ab2e-0689e3ea1e6a",
      "name": "Sticky - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Webhook & Topic Filter\nReceives the WooCommerce POST on `/order-update` (raw body is kept for the signature check).\n\n- **Is Order Processing?** continues only when header `x-wc-webhook-topic` = `order.processing`\n- Any other topic is acknowledged right away and ignored",
        "height": 650,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "b2d16e11-45ca-444d-9a06-14140eb53edc",
      "name": "Sticky - 1 Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Signature Verification\nBlocks forged or tampered requests.\n\n- **Calculate HMAC Signature** hashes the raw body (base64)\n- **Signature Valid?** compares it with header `x-wc-webhook-signature`\n- Mismatch → *Failure Handling* (section 6)",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "id": "361d94d3-b463-4abb-8a52-eecce32c6c2d",
      "name": "Sticky - 2 Signature"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Prepare Data\nBuilds a clean, safe payload for the sheet.\n\n- **Extract Order Fields:** order ID, customer name & email, status\n- **Sanitize Data:** removes line breaks, trims spaces, defaults `status_step` to 1",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "id": "f3735bb3-8440-4c28-a4ac-720fb15c410e",
      "name": "Sticky - 3 Prepare"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Update Tracking Sheet\nSends the order to the Google Apps Script web app (JSON + shared secret).\n\n- Errors never stop the run, the response is always inspected\n- **Update Successful?** checks the `ok` flag or HTTP 2xx\n- ✅ true → email the customer  ·  ❌ false → Failure Handling",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1800,
        0
      ],
      "id": "87c2f47d-4f83-4488-996a-7a331dd3013d",
      "name": "Sticky - 4 Tracking Sheet"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. Notify Customer\n- **Build Customer Email:** subject + HTML body with the `tracker_url` returned by Apps Script\n- **Send Tracking Email:** sent through Gmail\n- **Respond: Success:** returns HTTP 200 to WooCommerce with the Apps Script response",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 840,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        0
      ],
      "id": "93a3e319-cea7-4158-8cad-4a147a715b68",
      "name": "Sticky - 5 Success"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 6. Failure Handling\nReached when the signature is invalid or the sheet update fails.\n\n- **Build Failure Log:** event, order ID, reason, timestamp\n- **Log Failure:** reports the event to Apps Script\n- **Respond: Unauthorized:** returns HTTP 401 `{ ok: false, error }`",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 840,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        720
      ],
      "id": "ec5cb06c-cf3b-4f59-bf59-1d30ed4b05f3",
      "name": "Sticky - 6 Failure"
    },
